@startuml
autonumber
actor "Gym User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
User -> System : enterCredentials(email, password)
activate System

note right of System: The system validates input fields\nand verifies credentials with RestDB.

alt Valid Credentials
    System --> User : authenticates user, saves session, and shows Main Dashboard
else Invalid Credentials / Account Not Found
    System --> User : displays authentication error message (Toast)
end

deactivate System
deactivate User
@enduml
